Spotify declared war on AI slop. New AI Persona badges rolling out mid-September. If an artist profile is AI-generated — flagged. If they're suspicious but not confirmed — Likely AI Persona. And here's the nuclear option: AI Persona music gets EXCLUDED from editorial AND algorithmic recommendations. Tens of thousands of AI credits already submitted daily. Human artists get Verified badges. The line just got drawn.

