Google DeepMind quietly dropped Gemma 4 QAT — quantization-aware training that compresses models to 1GB. Gemma 4 26B A4B QAT runs on a PHONE. Multimodal. 256K context. Native tool use. Beats Gemma 3 by 25 points on AIME 2026. Triples LiveCodeBench. They're not chasing parameter counts — they're chasing DEPLOYABILITY.

